FIRST CVSS JSON schemas (cvss-v2.0.json, cvss-v3.0.json, cvss-v3.1.json,
cvss-v4.0.json) and their meta-schema (meta.json)

Source: https://github.com/oasis-tcs/csaf, commit 29b1e27, directory
csaf_2.1/referenced_schema/first/, which keeps copies of the schemas FIRST
publishes at https://www.first.org/cvss/. Kept byte for byte as published.

Licence: BSD-3-Clause. Each CVSS schema carries its licence in its "license"
field; the copyright lines are:

  cvss-v2.0.json: Copyright (c) 2017, FIRST.ORG, INC.
  cvss-v3.0.json: Copyright (c) 2017, FIRST.ORG, INC.
  cvss-v3.1.json: Copyright (c) 2021, FIRST.ORG, INC.
  cvss-v4.0.json: Copyright (c) 2025, FIRST.ORG, INC.

